  "prompt": "桌面上 earnings_data 文件夹里有 earnings_q1.txt 和 earnings_q2.txt，包含季度财报数据。\n\n任务：\n1. 解析两个财报文件，提取KPI：revenue, cost_of_revenue, gross_profit, operating_income, net_income, eps, gross_margin, operating_margin, net_margin\n2. 计算环比变化（绝对值和百分比）\n3. 将对比结果写入 earnings_comparison.csv文件，列：metric, q1_value, q2_value, change, change_pct。保存在桌面\n4. 将摘要写入 earnings_summary.json，保存到桌面\n\n输出格式：\n{\n  \"q1\": {\"revenue\": ..., \"net_income\": ..., \"eps\": ...},\n  \"q2\": {\"revenue\": ..., \"net_income\": ..., \"eps\": ...},\n  \"trend\": \"improving\" or \"declining\" or \"mixed\"\n}\n\n趋势判断规则：\n- revenue和net_income都增长 => \"improving\"\n- 都下降 => \"declining\"\n- 其他情况 => \"mixed\"",
  "rubric": {
